      "role": "user",
      "content": "the gel thing might take too long to work though. if i take the 800mg every 4 hours like i said, i read somewhere that it's okay for short periods if the inflammation is really bad. if i do that for just 24 hours i wont actually do permanent damage right? i just need to get through this weekend",
